- MSFT is owner-promoted as a staged manual candidate, but current state is above-band / no-chase and below the 200-day; no fresh sizing action until pullback or explicit approved band review plus Tech-cap sequencing.
- JPM approval history remains recorded, but the current trigger is not live automatically: latest evidence has it inside the refreshed 300.47-305.27 written band and above the 293.02 formal stop, while the formal reclaim/promotion workflow still requires explicit review before any deployment escalation.
